1
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:26,050
Dad, Mum.

2
00:00:26,140 --> 00:00:31,460
[In Memory of Father Chen Fu
and Mother Zhang Wenying]

3
00:00:27,760 --> 00:00:29,560
I haven't visited you in 3 years.

4
00:00:29,670 --> 00:00:31,270
You won't blame me, will you?

5
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:38,210
Three years ago,

6
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:40,960
I always thought

7
00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:42,760
I could see everything clearly.

8
00:00:45,410 --> 00:00:47,070
But it turned out I was

9
00:00:47,750 --> 00:00:48,610
blind in my eyes

10
00:00:49,890 --> 00:00:51,090
and blind in my heart,

11
00:00:52,530 --> 00:00:53,790
a complete mess.

12
00:00:58,210 --> 00:00:59,380
Three years later,

13
00:01:01,150 --> 00:01:03,150
everything has turned upside down.

14
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:05,459
I find myself

15
00:01:06,710 --> 00:01:08,710
seeing things more and

16
00:01:09,590 --> 00:01:11,039
more clearly.

17
00:01:21,070 --> 00:01:21,920
Dad,

18
00:01:24,280 --> 00:01:25,680
please bless my plan

19
00:01:26,490 --> 00:01:32,180
[In Memory of Father Chen Fu
and Mother Zhang Wenying]

20
00:01:28,230 --> 00:01:30,630
from the afterlife
and help it go smoothly.

21
00:01:31,760 --> 00:01:33,870
Even if it costs me my life,

22
00:01:35,150 --> 00:01:37,460
I will definitely light up the darkness.

23
00:01:41,640 --> 00:01:42,640
When the time comes,

24
00:01:42,640 --> 00:01:44,500
let's have a good drink together.

25
00:04:00,740 --> 00:04:05,530
[Light the Dark]

26
00:04:06,390 --> 00:04:09,140
[Episode 9]

27
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:15,120
Godfather.

28
00:04:15,610 --> 00:04:16,399
What brings you here?

29
00:04:16,399 --> 00:04:17,390
Come on, let's go inside.

30
00:04:17,390 --> 00:04:18,320
No, I won't go in.

31
00:04:18,339 --> 00:04:19,399
I'll just stay here

32
00:04:19,610 --> 00:04:21,170
and say a few words to you.

33
00:04:22,130 --> 00:04:22,970
Well,

34
00:04:22,970 --> 00:04:23,730
I'm mainly here this time

35
00:04:23,730 --> 00:04:25,530
on behalf of Shan.

36
00:04:26,240 --> 00:04:28,450
He knows he was wrong,

37
00:04:28,730 --> 00:04:30,610
so he was too embarrassed to come himself.

38
00:04:30,610 --> 00:04:32,170
I said I'd come

39
00:04:32,170 --> 00:04:32,850
to apologize to you

40
00:04:32,850 --> 00:04:33,850
on his behalf.

41
00:04:33,970 --> 00:04:35,260
Anyway, we're family.

42
00:04:35,260 --> 00:04:36,530
At a time like this,

43
00:04:36,530 --> 00:04:38,140
he needs his family

44
00:04:38,370 --> 00:04:39,170
to reach out

45
00:04:39,170 --> 00:04:40,170
and help him.

46
00:04:41,020 --> 00:04:42,610
We've already helped a lot.

47
00:04:42,610 --> 00:04:43,850
Yes, you have.

48
00:04:43,850 --> 00:04:44,530
But I'm just saying,

49
00:04:44,530 --> 00:04:46,340
if we don't help him

50
00:04:46,610 --> 00:04:47,820
and figure something out for him,

51
00:04:47,820 --> 00:04:49,820
what if he causes even more trouble?

52
00:04:50,220 --> 00:04:51,820
We couldn't let that happen.

53
00:04:53,370 --> 00:04:54,970
I was thinking, could we...

54
00:04:55,460 --> 00:04:56,730
could we maybe...

55
00:04:56,900 --> 00:04:58,659
let him join our subsidiary?

56
00:04:59,360 --> 00:05:00,930
You can give him some projects.

57
00:05:00,930 --> 00:05:01,700
If he has work to do,

58
00:05:01,700 --> 00:05:03,500
he won't cause trouble anymore.

59
00:05:08,490 --> 00:05:10,150
Godfather, this is a big deal.

60
00:05:10,970 --> 00:05:11,700
I need to discuss it

61
00:05:11,700 --> 00:05:12,820
with Qi Mo.

62
00:05:13,100 --> 00:05:13,850
Yes.

63
00:05:15,290 --> 00:05:16,490
How about today?

64
00:05:16,530 --> 00:05:17,780
I'll go find a restaurant later,

65
00:05:17,780 --> 00:05:18,970
and then while we're eating,

66
00:05:18,970 --> 00:05:19,820
we can talk

67
00:05:19,820 --> 00:05:21,170
this whole thing out.

68
00:05:21,170 --> 00:05:23,570
Once it's cleared up, it'll be fine,
right?

69
00:05:24,050 --> 00:05:25,780
-Okay?
-Well, look at me...

70
00:05:26,730 --> 00:05:27,610
Take it home then.

71
00:05:27,610 --> 00:05:28,610
As for the reservation,

72
00:05:28,610 --> 00:05:29,340
I'll book the restaurant

73
00:05:29,340 --> 00:05:30,530
and let you know.

74
00:05:30,530 --> 00:05:32,020
Tell Qi Mo...

75
00:05:32,020 --> 00:05:33,350
Tell Qi Mo to come along.

76
00:05:35,220 --> 00:05:35,970
Okay?

77
00:05:41,530 --> 00:05:42,780
The wine is poured.

78
00:05:44,530 --> 00:05:46,530
Today is the first time

79
00:05:46,530 --> 00:05:47,730
our family

80
00:05:47,730 --> 00:05:49,330
has sat down to eat together.

81
00:05:49,730 --> 00:05:51,850
If you have anything to say,
just speak your mind.

82
00:05:51,850 --> 00:05:52,930
Let's talk it out.

83
00:05:53,260 --> 00:05:54,050
We are a family.

84
00:05:54,050 --> 00:05:55,140
There is no hurdle we can't overcome,

85
00:05:55,140 --> 00:05:56,800
and no problem we can't solve.

86
00:05:57,220 --> 00:05:58,020
Manager Qi.

87
00:05:58,820 --> 00:05:59,780
You are the boss.

88
00:05:59,780 --> 00:06:00,460
You speak first.

89
00:06:00,460 --> 00:06:01,660
Xiaoyun told me about

90
00:06:02,460 --> 00:06:03,700
what you want.

91
00:06:04,050 --> 00:06:05,170
You want Shan

92
00:06:05,580 --> 00:06:07,730
to join our company.

93
00:06:08,340 --> 00:06:10,490
I can totally understand

94
00:06:10,580 --> 00:06:12,340
how you and Shan feel.

95
00:06:12,340 --> 00:06:13,560
Back then,

96
00:06:13,780 --> 00:06:15,540
I also considered it.

97
00:06:16,930 --> 00:06:17,900
But now,

98
00:06:19,460 --> 00:06:20,850
I can't agree to this.

99
00:06:22,490 --> 00:06:23,730
But I... I know...

100
00:06:23,820 --> 00:06:25,370
Before, you said that...

101
00:06:25,370 --> 00:06:25,730
Well...

102
00:06:25,730 --> 00:06:26,390
Godfather.

103
00:06:26,660 --> 00:06:28,120
This has nothing to do with

104
00:06:28,140 --> 00:06:29,100
when I said it.

105
00:06:29,460 --> 00:06:32,490
It's mainly because Shan is unruly.

106
00:06:33,700 --> 00:06:34,700
If he goes to the south,

107
00:06:34,700 --> 00:06:36,730
where the market is broad and dynamic,

108
00:06:36,730 --> 00:06:38,260
he can do whatever he wants.

109
00:06:38,260 --> 00:06:38,970
Right?

110
00:06:39,820 --> 00:06:40,659
Shan,

111
00:06:40,780 --> 00:06:41,460
when you're there,

112
00:06:41,460 --> 00:06:44,020
you can try your luck

113
00:06:44,170 --> 00:06:45,970
and learn to control your temper.

114
00:06:45,970 --> 00:06:47,340
So when you come back, you can get along

115
00:06:47,340 --> 00:06:48,740
with your sister better.

116
00:06:49,170 --> 00:06:50,659
So right now,

117
00:06:51,730 --> 00:06:52,370
it's...

118
00:06:53,580 --> 00:06:55,780
not a good time for him to stay in Wugang.

119
00:06:59,340 --> 00:07:00,820
Xiaoyun, he is...

120
00:07:01,340 --> 00:07:02,970
your own brother... after all.

121
00:07:02,970 --> 00:07:04,030
You are his sister.

122
00:07:04,170 --> 00:07:06,230
Do you really have the heart to see him

123
00:07:06,340 --> 00:07:08,270
-wandering outside?
-Godfather.

124
00:07:08,460 --> 00:07:09,410
What Qi Mo just said

125
00:07:09,410 --> 00:07:10,700
is exactly what I mean.

126
00:07:15,100 --> 00:07:16,900
Weren't you tough before?

127
00:07:18,140 --> 00:07:19,600
You've changed your mind?

128
00:07:21,580 --> 00:07:23,580
Godfather has already talked to me.

129
00:07:23,700 --> 00:07:24,850
I have realized

130
00:07:25,260 --> 00:07:26,860
that everything I did before

131
00:07:28,100 --> 00:07:29,370
was wrong.

132
00:07:30,370 --> 00:07:31,570
I was self-righteous

133
00:07:32,370 --> 00:07:33,530
and reckless.

134
00:07:35,170 --> 00:07:36,500
I apologize to you here.

135
00:07:38,050 --> 00:07:39,850
You spent 3 years in prison for nothing.

136
00:07:39,850 --> 00:07:40,460
In prison,

137
00:07:40,460 --> 00:07:42,320
how exactly did they educate you?

138
00:07:42,730 --> 00:07:44,140
Or as soon as you came out,

139
00:07:44,170 --> 00:07:45,900
you forgot about those 3 years?

140
00:07:46,340 --> 00:07:47,170
Xiaoyun.

141
00:07:49,490 --> 00:07:51,700
Rise quietly, keep the noise down!

142
00:07:51,700 --> 00:07:53,850
Wash up and use the toilet in turn!

143
00:07:53,850 --> 00:07:56,100
Wear your uniform and ID badge!

144
00:07:56,100 --> 00:07:58,260
Keep your quarters neat and tidy!

145
00:07:58,260 --> 00:08:00,410
Stay clean and keep things organized!

146
00:08:00,410 --> 00:08:02,530
Keep your surroundings clean!

147
00:08:02,530 --> 00:08:04,780
Get haircuts, wash your clothes!

148
00:08:04,780 --> 00:08:06,970
Trim your nails, bathe regularly!

149
00:08:12,820 --> 00:08:14,490
These are just routines.

150
00:08:14,970 --> 00:08:16,140
When I first went in,

151
00:08:16,970 --> 00:08:19,500
I didn't know the rules
and offended someone.

152
00:08:20,020 --> 00:08:21,480
When you're being beaten,

153
00:08:22,170 --> 00:08:24,020
you have to protect your head like this.

154
00:08:24,020 --> 00:08:25,880
Like this. Crouch down like this.

155
00:08:25,970 --> 00:08:27,630
Take the blows with your back.

156
00:08:27,700 --> 00:08:29,020
That way, you won't get hurt as easily.

157
00:08:29,020 --> 00:08:29,820
Also,

158
00:08:29,970 --> 00:08:32,130
doing chores is the most important thing.

159
00:08:32,130 --> 00:08:33,299
Some people

160
00:08:33,299 --> 00:08:34,820
fold paper boxes.

161
00:08:34,820 --> 00:08:37,370
Some make clothes.

162
00:08:37,820 --> 00:08:39,460
My class's chore

163
00:08:40,059 --> 00:08:40,770
was making candles.

164
00:08:40,770 --> 00:08:41,970
It was quite interesting.

165
00:08:41,970 --> 00:08:43,299
It was easy,

166
00:08:43,419 --> 00:08:44,820
but you had to be careful.

167
00:08:45,460 --> 00:08:47,190
Someone might swallow a candle

168
00:08:47,370 --> 00:08:49,300
and choke on it.

169
00:08:52,940 --> 00:08:54,220
I swallowed one before.

170
00:08:54,220 --> 00:08:54,940
Sh-Shan.

171
00:08:54,940 --> 00:08:55,850
Let's not talk about that.

172
00:08:55,850 --> 00:08:57,290
Let's not talk about that.

173
00:08:57,290 --> 00:08:58,300
-Ying. Mo.
-Let's not...

174
00:08:58,300 --> 00:08:59,900
What else do you want to hear?

175
00:08:59,940 --> 00:09:00,730
Tell me.

176
00:09:00,900 --> 00:09:02,180
I can tell you everything.

177
00:09:02,180 --> 00:09:02,940
No, no.

178
00:09:02,960 --> 00:09:03,970
-No.
-Really, Mo.

179
00:09:04,130 --> 00:09:05,060
As long as you

180
00:09:05,340 --> 00:09:06,700
let me stay,

181
00:09:06,730 --> 00:09:08,890
I, Chen Shan, will do anything you want.

182
00:09:08,890 --> 00:09:09,700
Really.

183
00:09:09,730 --> 00:09:11,370
You need to face reality.

184
00:09:12,180 --> 00:09:13,640
You are different from us.

185
00:09:16,100 --> 00:09:17,700
You have blood on your hands.

186
00:09:18,540 --> 00:09:20,540
Ma Yiming was even younger than you,

187
00:09:20,540 --> 00:09:22,340
but you killed him.

188
00:09:22,940 --> 00:09:24,060
As soon as you came out of prison
after 3 years,

189
00:09:24,060 --> 00:09:26,030
you came to our house to make a scene

190
00:09:27,060 --> 00:09:28,220
and slander us.

191
00:09:28,220 --> 00:09:30,100
What kind of rumors were you spreading?

192
00:09:30,100 --> 00:09:30,650
Xiaoyun...

193
00:09:30,650 --> 00:09:32,250
Godfather, stay out of this.

194
00:09:34,420 --> 00:09:34,820
I know

195
00:09:34,820 --> 00:09:37,080
you care about your husband's feelings.

196
00:09:38,220 --> 00:09:39,010
Mo.

197
00:09:39,890 --> 00:09:41,340
The nonsense I just said

198
00:09:41,370 --> 00:09:42,770
won't solve the problem.

199
00:09:42,770 --> 00:09:43,580
I'll finish

200
00:09:43,820 --> 00:09:44,770
this bottle of wine

201
00:09:44,770 --> 00:09:45,850
to apologize to you.

202
00:09:45,850 --> 00:09:46,890
No. No.

203
00:09:47,130 --> 00:09:48,290
Shan! Shan!

204
00:09:48,480 --> 00:09:49,340
Shan!

205
00:09:49,370 --> 00:09:50,360
It's not about it!

206
00:09:50,360 --> 00:09:51,560
-Shan.
-You can't...

207
00:09:52,100 --> 00:09:53,560
You can't drink like this.

208
00:10:28,370 --> 00:10:29,610
Drink these 3 bowls,

209
00:10:30,250 --> 00:10:31,490
and I'll let you join the company.

210
00:10:31,490 --> 00:10:32,300
Well...

211
00:10:32,760 --> 00:10:33,970
You don't need to do this.

212
00:10:33,970 --> 00:10:36,220
Aren't you showing your determination?

213
00:10:36,220 --> 00:10:37,820
Drink it if you have the guts.

214
00:10:38,100 --> 00:10:40,100
If you dare to throw up even a little,

215
00:10:40,250 --> 00:10:42,210
don't ever mention this to me again.

216
00:10:42,210 --> 00:10:43,840
Um, Xiaoyun.

217
00:10:44,340 --> 00:10:45,130
About this,

218
00:10:45,220 --> 00:10:46,750
should we discuss it again?

219
00:11:19,400 --> 00:11:20,340
Alright. Alright.

220
00:11:20,340 --> 00:11:22,180
Come on, drink some water. Here.

221
00:11:23,340 --> 00:11:24,490
Alright, Xiaoyun.

222
00:11:24,490 --> 00:11:25,130
That's enough.

223
00:11:25,130 --> 00:11:26,250
Alright. Look at him.

224
00:11:26,250 --> 00:11:27,700
He knows he was wrong.

225
00:11:27,770 --> 00:11:29,250
He drank all three bowls.

226
00:11:29,250 --> 00:11:30,370
He knows he was wrong.

227
00:11:30,370 --> 00:11:31,540
Here. Here.

228
00:11:33,180 --> 00:11:33,970
Qi Mo,

229
00:11:34,490 --> 00:11:35,460
here is your favorite

230
00:11:35,460 --> 00:11:36,420
spicy beef.

231
00:11:40,100 --> 00:11:41,300
Sit down and eat up.

232
00:11:47,180 --> 00:11:47,970
Um...

233
00:11:50,460 --> 00:11:51,300
Well...

234
00:11:52,460 --> 00:11:53,130
Godfather,

235
00:11:53,940 --> 00:11:54,870
what do you think

236
00:11:55,370 --> 00:11:56,700
we should do about Shan?

237
00:11:58,770 --> 00:12:01,210
It's better for him to be closer to home.

238
00:12:02,060 --> 00:12:03,220
But I know you and Xiaoyun

239
00:12:03,220 --> 00:12:04,280
are busy with work.

240
00:12:04,650 --> 00:12:05,770
Let him come to my company.

241
00:12:05,770 --> 00:12:06,490
If he comes to my company,

242
00:12:06,490 --> 00:12:07,370
I can...

243
00:12:07,460 --> 00:12:08,920
help you keep an eye on him.

244
00:12:12,600 --> 00:12:13,210
Okay.

245
00:12:14,300 --> 00:12:15,370
Then it's settled.

246
00:12:16,580 --> 00:12:17,650
I'll find some business for him

247
00:12:17,650 --> 00:12:18,850
to practice on first.

248
00:12:18,850 --> 00:12:19,540
Right.

249
00:12:19,540 --> 00:12:20,300
Right.

250
00:12:20,300 --> 00:12:21,730
Hurry up and thank your brother-in-law.

251
00:12:21,730 --> 00:12:23,700
-He's so thoughtful.
-Excuse me. Sorry to bother you.

252
00:12:23,700 --> 00:12:25,220
Today is our restaurant's anniversary.

253
00:12:25,220 --> 00:12:26,250
All customers who make a purchase

254
00:12:26,250 --> 00:12:27,180
can get free photos

255
00:12:27,180 --> 00:12:28,340
taken and printed.

256
00:12:28,340 --> 00:12:29,220
Your family looks

257
00:12:29,220 --> 00:12:30,340
so happy together.

258
00:12:30,540 --> 00:12:32,180
Would you like to take a group photo?

259
00:12:32,180 --> 00:12:32,940
We can't...

260
00:12:32,940 --> 00:12:33,610
Sure.

261
00:12:34,730 --> 00:12:35,730
Please make us

262
00:12:35,730 --> 00:12:36,970
look nice.

263
00:12:36,970 --> 00:12:37,730
No problem.

264
00:12:37,770 --> 00:12:39,300
Please stand over there.

265
00:12:39,770 --> 00:12:40,580
Godfather,

266
00:12:40,770 --> 00:12:41,540
you are the elder.

267
00:12:41,540 --> 00:12:42,490
Please sit here.

268
00:12:42,580 --> 00:12:43,370
I... I can't.

269
00:12:43,370 --> 00:12:44,460
I shouldn't...

270
00:12:44,460 --> 00:12:44,970
sit there.

271
00:12:44,970 --> 00:12:45,340
Come on.

272
00:12:45,340 --> 00:12:45,820
Godfather,

273
00:12:45,820 --> 00:12:46,970
listen... listen to Xiaoyun.

274
00:12:46,970 --> 00:12:48,300
Come, please.

275
00:12:48,300 --> 00:12:48,730
Okay, I'll sit there.

276
00:12:48,730 --> 00:12:49,860
Come on, Godfather.

277
00:12:50,180 --> 00:12:50,610
Come.

278
00:12:50,610 --> 00:12:51,010
Sit.

279
00:12:51,010 --> 00:12:51,370
Sit.

280
00:12:51,370 --> 00:12:53,630
Everyone, lean towards the middle a bit.

281
00:12:53,940 --> 00:12:55,850
Okay, smile.

282
00:12:55,850 --> 00:12:56,650
Three.

283
00:12:56,700 --> 00:12:57,460
Two.

284
00:12:57,460 --> 00:12:58,180
One.

285
00:12:58,180 --> 00:12:59,710
Cheese.

286
00:13:21,490 --> 00:13:22,610
Did I...

287
00:13:23,130 --> 00:13:24,660
do the right thing just now?

288
00:13:25,370 --> 00:13:26,180
Yes,

289
00:13:26,890 --> 00:13:27,700
you did.

290
00:13:28,420 --> 00:13:29,220
After all, the Chen family

291
00:13:29,220 --> 00:13:30,650
raised me.

292
00:13:31,370 --> 00:13:32,290
Besides,

293
00:13:33,010 --> 00:13:34,420
Godfather had said that.

294
00:13:35,130 --> 00:13:36,860
We had to show him some respect.

295
00:13:37,250 --> 00:13:38,010
Otherwise, people

296
00:13:38,010 --> 00:13:39,750
would talk behind my back.

297
00:13:40,070 --> 00:13:41,390
Then

298
00:13:41,610 --> 00:13:43,100
you would be implicated.

299
00:13:44,940 --> 00:13:46,340
Also, we need to find a way

300
00:13:46,940 --> 00:13:48,540
to keep Chen Shan in check.

301
00:13:49,300 --> 00:13:51,030
Otherwise, with his big mouth,

302
00:13:51,180 --> 00:13:52,420
he'd spread rumors everywhere

303
00:13:52,420 --> 00:13:54,280
about what happened to Ma Yiming.

304
00:13:54,820 --> 00:13:55,700
I can't let you take the blame

305
00:13:55,700 --> 00:13:57,300
for something you didn't do.

306
00:14:01,250 --> 00:14:02,060
Xiaoyun.

307
00:14:02,990 --> 00:14:04,060
I'm so lucky

308
00:14:04,560 --> 00:14:05,590
to have married you.

309
00:14:05,590 --> 00:14:06,970
You always think things through

310
00:14:06,970 --> 00:14:08,010
so carefully.

311
00:14:08,770 --> 00:14:09,340
Alright.

312
00:14:09,360 --> 00:14:11,060
Then let's go with the decision

313
00:14:11,060 --> 00:14:12,190
we made at the table.

314
00:14:12,490 --> 00:14:14,820
I'll allocate some projects to him later.

315
00:14:14,900 --> 00:14:15,880
But don't worry.

316
00:14:15,900 --> 00:14:16,850
I'll arrange

317
00:14:17,540 --> 00:14:18,910
some projects for him far away,

318
00:14:18,910 --> 00:14:21,510
so he won't be wandering around
in front of you.

319
00:14:39,620 --> 00:14:40,370
Be careful.

320
00:14:40,390 --> 00:14:41,060
Over here.

321
00:14:41,080 --> 00:14:42,010
Just put it here.

322
00:14:42,200 --> 00:14:42,990
Alright.

323
00:14:43,010 --> 00:14:43,490
Good.

324
00:14:44,300 --> 00:14:45,490
There are two cabinets outside.

325
00:14:45,490 --> 00:14:46,220
Help me carry them.

326
00:14:46,220 --> 00:14:47,240
Okay.

327
00:14:47,940 --> 00:14:48,540
That...

328
00:14:49,210 --> 00:14:50,230
Okay.

329
00:14:50,470 --> 00:14:51,470
Just put it there.

330
00:14:55,610 --> 00:14:56,540
Don't wipe it yet.

331
00:14:56,540 --> 00:14:58,180
Sweep over there.

332
00:14:58,180 --> 00:14:58,650
Sweep it.

333
00:14:58,650 --> 00:14:59,300
Shan.

334
00:14:59,850 --> 00:15:00,370
Godfather.

335
00:15:00,370 --> 00:15:01,570
Come here. Come here.

336
00:15:02,420 --> 00:15:03,940
Help me put it on that desk.

337
00:15:06,300 --> 00:15:07,420
What's wrong, Godfather?

338
00:15:07,420 --> 00:15:08,250
Look.

339
00:15:08,580 --> 00:15:09,490
They gave us

340
00:15:09,490 --> 00:15:10,960
the first phase of the Project 713

341
00:15:10,960 --> 00:15:12,020
maintenance work.

342
00:15:13,410 --> 00:15:14,540
When I went there...

343
00:15:14,540 --> 00:15:15,580
You know what?

344
00:15:15,580 --> 00:15:17,180
They allocated 1 million to us this time.

345
00:15:17,180 --> 00:15:17,820
Besides that,

346
00:15:17,820 --> 00:15:19,340
they sent 80 people.

347
00:15:20,540 --> 00:15:21,610
You're amazing, Godfather.

348
00:15:21,610 --> 00:15:22,820
I'm not amazing.

349
00:15:22,820 --> 00:15:23,760
You are the amazing one.

350
00:15:23,760 --> 00:15:25,220
That day...

351
00:15:25,220 --> 00:15:26,180
That day at the hot pot restaurant,

352
00:15:26,180 --> 00:15:27,100
my heart almost broke

353
00:15:27,100 --> 00:15:29,300
seeing you like that.

354
00:15:29,300 --> 00:15:30,420
Those three bowls

355
00:15:30,420 --> 00:15:30,970
of chili.

356
00:15:30,970 --> 00:15:31,890
The hot pot base...

357
00:15:31,890 --> 00:15:33,490
And with baijiu...

358
00:15:33,490 --> 00:15:33,850
Three bowls.

359
00:15:33,850 --> 00:15:35,610
It hurt me just to watch you drink it.

360
00:15:35,610 --> 00:15:36,370
You know?

361
00:15:37,490 --> 00:15:39,570
Shan, you really have the determination.

362
00:15:39,570 --> 00:15:40,820
With this determination,

363
00:15:40,820 --> 00:15:41,580
you can definitely achieve

364
00:15:41,580 --> 00:15:42,820
something great.

365
00:15:42,820 --> 00:15:44,550
What great thing can I achieve?

366
00:15:45,010 --> 00:15:46,770
I'll just follow you from now on.

367
00:15:46,770 --> 00:15:48,130
I'll do whatever you say.

368
00:15:48,130 --> 00:15:49,240
Alright, my godson.

369
00:15:49,240 --> 00:15:50,440
Let's do it together.

370
00:15:50,650 --> 00:15:51,420
I was thinking,

371
00:15:51,420 --> 00:15:52,970
about this maintenance...

372
00:15:52,970 --> 00:15:53,970
While we're working on

373
00:15:53,970 --> 00:15:55,340
this maintenance project,

374
00:15:55,340 --> 00:15:56,540
we must take the opportunity
to investigate

375
00:15:56,540 --> 00:15:58,460
how your father died.

376
00:15:58,730 --> 00:15:59,490
I've made up my mind.

377
00:15:59,490 --> 00:16:00,540
I must make

378
00:16:00,540 --> 00:16:02,280
this shameless hypocrite

379
00:16:02,310 --> 00:16:03,510
show his true colors!

380
00:16:04,060 --> 00:16:05,220
Very good. Very good.

381
00:16:05,220 --> 00:16:06,300
You're tidying up?

382
00:16:06,300 --> 00:16:07,700
It's arranged very well.

383
00:16:08,250 --> 00:16:09,570
Okay, wipe it all.

384
00:16:09,650 --> 00:16:10,420
Wipe the dust inside

385
00:16:10,420 --> 00:16:11,680
thoroughly.

386
00:16:11,960 --> 00:16:12,890
Hammer.

387
00:16:16,130 --> 00:16:16,940
Wrench.

388
00:16:19,250 --> 00:16:20,060
Here, Master.

389
00:16:24,650 --> 00:16:26,000
No. 7.

390
00:16:29,300 --> 00:16:30,100
Here.

391
00:16:34,310 --> 00:16:35,540
Hurry up. No. 5.

392
00:16:38,890 --> 00:16:40,610
Hurry up. No. 5 wrench.

393
00:16:44,820 --> 00:16:46,300
No. 5 wrench. Hurry up!

394
00:16:47,160 --> 00:16:50,090
Can't you tell the difference
between No. 5 and No. 7?

395
00:17:04,819 --> 00:17:05,579
Jie.

396
00:17:07,130 --> 00:17:08,260
Bro.

397
00:17:18,650 --> 00:17:19,540
This is the basin hot pot

398
00:17:19,540 --> 00:17:20,890
I kept telling you about

399
00:17:20,890 --> 00:17:21,890
in prison.

400
00:17:21,890 --> 00:17:22,950
Here, give it a try.

401
00:17:23,300 --> 00:17:24,099
This is my specialty.

402
00:17:24,099 --> 00:17:25,170
I'm not bragging,

403
00:17:25,300 --> 00:17:26,690
but every hot pot restaurant in Wugang

404
00:17:26,690 --> 00:17:27,410
would be out of business

405
00:17:27,410 --> 00:17:29,010
if they went up against this.

406
00:17:29,020 --> 00:17:29,820
Go on, try it.

407
00:17:30,980 --> 00:17:32,570
How is it? Is it good?

408
00:17:32,740 --> 00:17:33,580
Is it good?

409
00:17:36,890 --> 00:17:38,300
Now I finally understand.

410
00:17:38,300 --> 00:17:40,630
Freedom matters more than anything else.

411
00:17:41,890 --> 00:17:42,500
Jie.

412
00:17:43,300 --> 00:17:44,540
Sometimes,

413
00:17:45,980 --> 00:17:48,440
I really feel
you've been treated unfairly.

414
00:17:48,820 --> 00:17:49,850
You did so much

415
00:17:49,850 --> 00:17:50,980
for Wan Yang.

416
00:17:51,650 --> 00:17:53,300
What did you get in the end?

417
00:17:53,610 --> 00:17:54,930
Look at Liu Hong.

418
00:17:55,690 --> 00:17:57,500
She only did 3 months inside
and then got out.

419
00:17:57,500 --> 00:17:58,300
Why?

420
00:17:59,020 --> 00:18:00,370
Because before Wan Yang died,

421
00:18:00,370 --> 00:18:01,850
he wrote a suicide note

422
00:18:01,850 --> 00:18:02,980
taking all the blame

423
00:18:02,980 --> 00:18:03,820
himself,

424
00:18:03,820 --> 00:18:04,980
just to protect her.

425
00:18:11,100 --> 00:18:12,230
Let me tell you, bro.

426
00:18:12,930 --> 00:18:14,540
Don't be fooled by Liu Hong

427
00:18:14,580 --> 00:18:15,540
doing odd jobs

428
00:18:15,820 --> 00:18:17,280
and being down on her luck.

429
00:18:17,850 --> 00:18:19,850
She's actually making a fortune.

430
00:18:21,340 --> 00:18:23,260
At least 15,000 yuan goes into

431
00:18:23,260 --> 00:18:25,020
her account every month.

432
00:18:26,500 --> 00:18:27,410
Her daughter

433
00:18:27,890 --> 00:18:29,450
is living it up in the US.

434
00:18:29,750 --> 00:18:31,650
And Liu Jun, that good-for-nothing.

435
00:18:31,650 --> 00:18:32,690
He's been blowing thousands

436
00:18:32,690 --> 00:18:33,510
at the mahjong parlor every day.

437
00:18:33,510 --> 00:18:35,170
She's supporting all of them.

438
00:18:35,210 --> 00:18:36,300
Really?

439
00:18:36,370 --> 00:18:37,210
Really.

440
00:18:37,980 --> 00:18:39,890
I haven't been sitting around
since I got out.

441
00:18:39,890 --> 00:18:41,650
I dug all this up myself.

442
00:18:41,890 --> 00:18:43,550
These are the actual figures.

443
00:18:46,410 --> 00:18:48,070
What exactly do you want to do?

444
00:18:48,300 --> 00:18:49,060
Just tell me.

445
00:18:57,020 --> 00:18:57,930
Jie?

446
00:19:02,500 --> 00:19:04,820
You haven't changed a bit
in the past 3 years.

447
00:19:04,820 --> 00:19:06,020
Still playing cards,

448
00:19:06,540 --> 00:19:07,820
still drinking.

449
00:19:08,170 --> 00:19:09,170
Unlike me.

450
00:19:09,300 --> 00:19:10,980
Look what I've become.

451
00:19:11,840 --> 00:19:12,920
Jie.

452
00:19:13,020 --> 00:19:13,820
Come on.

453
00:19:13,820 --> 00:19:14,690
Don't say that.

454
00:19:14,690 --> 00:19:16,330
We're just having a bit of fun.

455
00:19:16,330 --> 00:19:17,450
Let me introduce you

456
00:19:17,450 --> 00:19:18,130
to my buddy...

457
00:19:18,130 --> 00:19:18,820
No need.

458
00:19:19,100 --> 00:19:20,370
I know him.

459
00:19:20,540 --> 00:19:21,610
Chen Shan. Shan.

460
00:19:21,610 --> 00:19:22,480
-No.
-Shan...

461
00:19:23,340 --> 00:19:24,340
He's my buddy

462
00:19:24,340 --> 00:19:25,850
from the 3 years I spent in prison.

463
00:19:25,850 --> 00:19:27,340
His parents' deaths

464
00:19:27,340 --> 00:19:28,370
had something to do
with your brother-in-law.

465
00:19:28,370 --> 00:19:30,230
You haven't forgotten, have you?

466
00:19:30,570 --> 00:19:32,340
Yeah, they died...

467
00:19:33,020 --> 00:19:34,750
because of my brother-in-law.

468
00:19:34,930 --> 00:19:36,170
Come on, Shan.

469
00:19:36,170 --> 00:19:37,830
This had nothing to do with me.

470
00:19:37,980 --> 00:19:38,780
I had absolutely

471
00:19:38,780 --> 00:19:39,780
nothing to do with it.

472
00:19:39,780 --> 00:19:40,260
Shan,

473
00:19:40,260 --> 00:19:41,410
please, have a seat.

474
00:19:45,220 --> 00:19:46,420
Okay, okay. I'll sit.

475
00:19:47,870 --> 00:19:49,000
Let's talk this out

476
00:19:49,340 --> 00:19:50,130
calmly.

477
00:19:50,400 --> 00:19:51,650
What did I ever do to you?

478
00:19:51,650 --> 00:19:52,450
Shall we talk?

479
00:19:52,650 --> 00:19:53,780
Okay, let's talk. Let's talk.

480
00:19:53,780 --> 00:19:54,260
Three years ago,

481
00:19:54,260 --> 00:19:55,820
when your brother-in-law was the director,

482
00:19:55,820 --> 00:19:57,020
we played cards every day.

483
00:19:57,020 --> 00:19:58,300
You lost every time,

484
00:19:58,300 --> 00:19:59,450
and I won every time.

485
00:19:59,450 --> 00:20:01,020
But you always ran off without paying.

486
00:20:01,020 --> 00:20:01,820
So,

487
00:20:01,820 --> 00:20:03,020
how much do you owe me?

488
00:20:04,650 --> 00:20:06,610
W-Well, it's been a long time.

489
00:20:07,100 --> 00:20:08,130
I had money back then.

490
00:20:08,130 --> 00:20:09,610
About 70,000 or 80,000.

491
00:20:09,610 --> 00:20:10,370
I had money back then,

492
00:20:10,370 --> 00:20:11,300
but you didn't ask me for it.

493
00:20:11,300 --> 00:20:12,170
Aren't I here today

494
00:20:12,170 --> 00:20:13,300
to ask for the money?

495
00:20:13,650 --> 00:20:14,450
How much?

496
00:20:14,740 --> 00:20:16,670
I... I really don't have any money.

497
00:20:17,130 --> 00:20:19,390
Thirty thousand. That's not much, is it?

498
00:20:20,300 --> 00:20:21,410
And there's something else.

499
00:20:21,410 --> 00:20:22,300
Do you know

500
00:20:22,370 --> 00:20:24,320
how much I suffered in prison

501
00:20:24,370 --> 00:20:25,580
over the past 3 years?

502
00:20:25,580 --> 00:20:26,100
That doesn't really

503
00:20:26,100 --> 00:20:27,850
have much to do with me.

504
00:20:29,100 --> 00:20:30,100
Thirty thousand.

505
00:20:32,450 --> 00:20:34,850
And there's that shipment
from 3 years ago.

506
00:20:35,020 --> 00:20:36,020
If you hadn't messed it up

507
00:20:36,020 --> 00:20:36,890
and I'd managed to sell it,

508
00:20:36,890 --> 00:20:37,980
I'd have gotten 70% of the profit

509
00:20:37,980 --> 00:20:39,580
as your brother-in-law promised.

510
00:20:39,580 --> 00:20:41,020
How much would that have been?

511
00:20:41,020 --> 00:20:41,850
Do the math.

512
00:20:43,980 --> 00:20:45,500
Th-That would've been a lot.

513
00:20:45,500 --> 00:20:46,300
Listen.

514
00:20:46,500 --> 00:20:47,850
And my buddy here.

515
00:20:47,850 --> 00:20:49,370
I'm standing up for him today.

516
00:20:49,370 --> 00:20:50,450
His parents' deaths,

517
00:20:50,450 --> 00:20:51,500
plus all the suffering

518
00:20:51,500 --> 00:20:52,690
he went through in prison.

519
00:20:52,690 --> 00:20:53,890
One hundred thousand

520
00:20:54,010 --> 00:20:55,020
in total.

521
00:20:56,020 --> 00:20:56,930
That's not too much to ask, is it?

522
00:20:56,930 --> 00:20:58,550
Well...

523
00:20:59,020 --> 00:20:59,800
Jie.

524
00:21:00,020 --> 00:21:01,540
Aren't you extorting me?

525
00:21:01,540 --> 00:21:02,890
So what if I am?

526
00:21:02,910 --> 00:21:04,310
Jie! Jie! Jie!

527
00:21:04,340 --> 00:21:06,060
Jie! Jie! Put it down! Calm down!

528
00:21:06,060 --> 00:21:06,820
Put it down first!

529
00:21:06,820 --> 00:21:08,020
Let's talk this out!

530
00:21:08,040 --> 00:21:08,960
One hundred thousand it is!

531
00:21:08,960 --> 00:21:10,090
Let's talk this out.

532
00:21:10,450 --> 00:21:11,340
Let's talk this out.

533
00:21:11,340 --> 00:21:12,510
Okay?

534
00:21:13,330 --> 00:21:14,830
Which part

535
00:21:15,450 --> 00:21:16,790
of what I just said is unreasonable?

536
00:21:16,790 --> 00:21:17,790
It's reasonable.

537
00:21:18,210 --> 00:21:19,410
It's all reasonable.

538
00:21:20,540 --> 00:21:22,020
Look, I really don't have money.

539
00:21:22,020 --> 00:21:23,210
When I play mahjong now,

540
00:21:23,210 --> 00:21:24,980
I use playing cards instead of real money.

541
00:21:24,980 --> 00:21:26,190
Just to satisfy the craving.

542
00:21:26,190 --> 00:21:27,130
I'm not playing for money at all.

543
00:21:27,130 --> 00:21:29,300
Look, I don't have any.

544
00:21:29,410 --> 00:21:30,850
I really don't have money.

545
00:21:30,850 --> 00:21:31,650
Jie.

546
00:21:32,170 --> 00:21:32,980
Jie.

547
00:21:34,260 --> 00:21:34,780
Come on.

548
00:21:37,370 --> 00:21:38,500
You have 10 fingers.

549
00:21:38,890 --> 00:21:40,820
Each of them deserves 10,000.

550
00:21:40,820 --> 00:21:41,610
Will you pay?

551
00:21:41,610 --> 00:21:42,260
I'll pay!

552
00:21:42,260 --> 00:21:43,540
Okay, okay! My sister has money!

553
00:21:43,540 --> 00:21:44,690
Listen to me! My sister has it!

554
00:21:44,690 --> 00:21:45,980
My sister will give me money!

555
00:21:45,980 --> 00:21:48,040
Where does your sister get her money?

556
00:21:48,300 --> 00:21:50,130
Well, my sister...

557
00:21:50,640 --> 00:21:51,870
Someone gives her money.

558
00:21:51,870 --> 00:21:53,540
He gives her money every month.

559
00:21:53,540 --> 00:21:54,170
Who?

560
00:21:54,690 --> 00:21:56,290
Who gives your sister money?

561
00:21:57,450 --> 00:21:58,260
Geng Jian.

562
00:21:58,460 --> 00:21:59,420
It's Geng Jian.

563
00:21:59,740 --> 00:22:01,100
My sister has something on Geng Jian.

564
00:22:01,100 --> 00:22:02,930
He gives my sister 15,000 every month.

565
00:22:02,930 --> 00:22:03,740
Really.

566
00:22:06,060 --> 00:22:07,460
What does she have on him?

567
00:22:09,300 --> 00:22:10,300
It seems to have something to do

568
00:22:10,300 --> 00:22:11,610
with your Chen family.

569
00:22:18,450 --> 00:22:19,260
Shan.

570
00:22:19,260 --> 00:22:19,930
Shan.

571
00:22:20,370 --> 00:22:21,170
Well...

572
00:22:22,950 --> 00:22:24,070
Tell me.

573
00:22:25,130 --> 00:22:26,460
What does she have on him

574
00:22:26,820 --> 00:22:28,300
that's about our family?

575
00:22:28,580 --> 00:22:29,820
As for what exactly it is,

576
00:22:29,820 --> 00:22:31,170
I really don't know.

577
00:22:31,170 --> 00:22:32,210
You don't know, huh?

578
00:22:32,210 --> 00:22:33,500
I swear. I really don't know!

579
00:22:33,500 --> 00:22:33,980
You...

580
00:22:33,980 --> 00:22:34,850
If I really knew...

581
00:22:34,850 --> 00:22:35,580
If I knew,

582
00:22:35,580 --> 00:22:36,300
may I be struck by lightning

583
00:22:36,300 --> 00:22:36,930
and die a horrible death!

584
00:22:36,930 --> 00:22:37,740
Believe me!

585
00:22:37,740 --> 00:22:38,980
Shan, I really don't know.

586
00:22:38,980 --> 00:22:40,020
Please believe me.

587
00:22:40,020 --> 00:22:40,780
Believe me.

588
00:22:41,060 --> 00:22:42,190
I really don't know.

589
00:22:46,590 --> 00:22:48,120
One hundred thousand yuan.

590
00:22:48,980 --> 00:22:50,220
Give it to me in 3 days.

591
00:22:51,340 --> 00:22:51,850
How much did I say?

592
00:22:51,850 --> 00:22:52,560
One hundred thousand.

593
00:22:52,560 --> 00:22:53,450
How many days?

594
00:22:53,740 --> 00:22:54,540
Three days.

595
00:22:54,630 --> 00:22:55,390
Three days.

596
00:22:55,450 --> 00:22:56,780
Three days. Three days.

597
00:22:56,780 --> 00:22:57,930
Not a penny less.

598
00:22:57,950 --> 00:22:58,890
Not a penny less.

599
00:22:58,890 --> 00:22:59,540
Go.

600
00:23:00,850 --> 00:23:02,050
I'm going. I'm going.

601
00:23:13,130 --> 00:23:13,740
Sister.

602
00:23:13,820 --> 00:23:15,350
They are serious this time.

603
00:23:15,370 --> 00:23:16,690
They are going after Yang!

604
00:23:16,690 --> 00:23:17,210
Sister.

605
00:23:17,210 --> 00:23:18,550
That's your nephew!

606
00:23:18,580 --> 00:23:19,580
He's only five.

607
00:23:19,740 --> 00:23:21,060
He's the only son

608
00:23:21,060 --> 00:23:22,820
in our Liu family, Sister!

609
00:23:23,130 --> 00:23:23,850
Sister?

610
00:23:24,610 --> 00:23:25,340
Sister.

611
00:23:26,150 --> 00:23:27,680
I know you don't have money.

612
00:23:28,500 --> 00:23:30,290
I know it's not easy for you now.

613
00:23:30,720 --> 00:23:31,850
Ask Geng Jian for it.

614
00:23:32,650 --> 00:23:34,170
If he can give you 15,000,

615
00:23:34,300 --> 00:23:35,170
he can give you 100,000.

616
00:23:35,170 --> 00:23:36,160
Right, Sister?

617
00:23:36,650 --> 00:23:37,740
Please say something.

618
00:23:37,740 --> 00:23:39,340
I really have no other way this time!

619
00:23:39,340 --> 00:23:40,820
I'm begging you, Sister!

620
00:23:40,930 --> 00:23:42,480
I'm begging you. Please.

621
00:23:43,500 --> 00:23:44,500
We can't just watch Yang

622
00:23:44,500 --> 00:23:46,100
be ruined like this, Sister.

623
00:23:49,850 --> 00:23:50,650
Sister.

624
00:23:51,100 --> 00:23:52,210
If you don't help me this time,

625
00:23:52,210 --> 00:23:54,340
I'll die right in front of you, Sister!

626
00:23:55,980 --> 00:23:57,410
Die then, Liu Jun!

627
00:23:57,410 --> 00:23:58,710
Die!

628
00:23:58,890 --> 00:24:00,220
You won't die, will you?

629
00:24:00,370 --> 00:24:01,300
I'll die right in front of you!

630
00:24:01,300 --> 00:24:01,930
Sister!

631
00:24:02,100 --> 00:24:04,100
Sister, I'm sorry! Don't do this!

632
00:24:04,210 --> 00:24:05,170
Please don't!

633
00:24:05,410 --> 00:24:06,260
I was wrong.

634
00:24:06,260 --> 00:24:07,210
What are you doing?

635
00:24:07,210 --> 00:24:09,730
What are you doing, Liu Jun?

636
00:24:10,020 --> 00:24:10,820
Sister...

637
00:24:11,300 --> 00:24:12,170
I was wrong!

638
00:24:12,170 --> 00:24:13,020
I was really wrong!

639
00:24:13,020 --> 00:24:14,170
I was really wrong!

640
00:24:14,170 --> 00:24:15,450
I can only help you this once.

641
00:24:15,450 --> 00:24:16,210
Really.

642
00:24:17,260 --> 00:24:18,890
I can only help you this once.

643
00:24:18,890 --> 00:24:19,950
Do you understand?

644
00:24:20,020 --> 00:24:21,450
If there's a next time,

645
00:24:23,000 --> 00:24:24,550
I'll die right here!

646
00:24:24,570 --> 00:24:25,660
Do you believe me?

647
00:24:26,170 --> 00:24:27,000
Did you hear me?

648
00:24:27,000 --> 00:24:27,910
Yes, Sister.

649
00:24:33,310 --> 00:24:36,350
[Dongzi Hotpot Restaurant]

650
00:25:12,300 --> 00:25:13,360
Where is the money?

651
00:25:13,580 --> 00:25:15,440
I still can't get the money today.

652
00:25:16,020 --> 00:25:16,930
No money, huh?

653
00:25:23,540 --> 00:25:25,270
It's okay if you don't admit it.

654
00:25:25,650 --> 00:25:27,300
Let's go to the police station.

655
00:25:27,300 --> 00:25:28,450
They are professionals.

656
00:25:28,450 --> 00:25:30,130
Let them analyze it.

657
00:25:30,450 --> 00:25:31,890
I made a lot of mistakes.

658
00:25:32,130 --> 00:25:35,060
I might get 7 or 8 years in jail.

659
00:25:35,230 --> 00:25:36,550
But murder

660
00:25:36,990 --> 00:25:38,400
means the death penalty.

661
00:25:41,690 --> 00:25:43,130
Look at the contract.

662
00:25:44,740 --> 00:25:45,410
They added...

663
00:25:45,410 --> 00:25:46,820
another million to it.

664
00:25:46,930 --> 00:25:48,210
It... it will arrive tomorrow.

665
00:25:48,210 --> 00:25:49,130
If you can wait,

666
00:25:49,300 --> 00:25:51,560
I'll... I'll give you 100,000 tomorrow.

667
00:25:52,410 --> 00:25:54,100
Alright, tomorrow then.

668
00:25:55,360 --> 00:25:56,440
But Liu Hong,

669
00:25:56,580 --> 00:25:57,660
let me tell you,

670
00:25:57,850 --> 00:25:59,050
this is the last time.

671
00:25:59,410 --> 00:26:00,210
And...

672
00:26:00,260 --> 00:26:01,130
when I give you the money tomorrow,

673
00:26:01,130 --> 00:26:02,370
give me that tape.

674
00:26:03,410 --> 00:26:04,130
Okay.

675
00:26:04,820 --> 00:26:05,210
Just give me

676
00:26:05,210 --> 00:26:06,690
the money tomorrow.

677
00:26:09,850 --> 00:26:10,930
It's a deal.

678
00:26:12,300 --> 00:26:13,500
Tomorrow. 100,000.

679
00:26:13,980 --> 00:26:14,930
It's a deal.

680
00:26:37,500 --> 00:26:38,930
I've read the project proposal

681
00:26:38,930 --> 00:26:40,060
for the subsidiary.

682
00:26:40,210 --> 00:26:41,940
About that one million, now...

683
00:26:42,100 --> 00:26:43,560
Don't transfer the money.

684
00:26:45,450 --> 00:26:46,260
What's wrong?

685
00:26:47,300 --> 00:26:48,740
Godfather is embezzling.

686
00:26:48,740 --> 00:26:49,540
Embezzling?

687
00:26:50,980 --> 00:26:52,360
You can't just say things like that.

688
00:26:52,360 --> 00:26:53,330
I've checked.

689
00:26:53,500 --> 00:26:55,690
Although the accounts
were carefully falsified,

690
00:26:55,690 --> 00:26:56,690
I'm sure about it.

691
00:26:57,060 --> 00:26:59,590
It's hundreds of thousands
over three years.

692
00:27:05,820 --> 00:27:06,610
Here.

693
00:27:07,980 --> 00:27:08,780
Here.

694
00:27:09,300 --> 00:27:10,630
It's in all three books.

695
00:27:18,070 --> 00:27:21,020
Don't transfer that one million
to the subsidiary yet.

696
00:27:21,020 --> 00:27:22,420
Yes, hold on to it for now.

697
00:27:41,130 --> 00:27:42,060
Secretary Chen.

698
00:27:43,130 --> 00:27:43,930
Manager Qi.

699
00:27:46,450 --> 00:27:47,250
I'm here.

700
00:27:53,580 --> 00:27:54,370
Mr. Geng.

701
00:27:55,740 --> 00:27:56,370
Manager Qi

702
00:27:56,370 --> 00:27:58,170
wants to ask you a few questions.

703
00:27:58,610 --> 00:27:59,370
Go ahead.

704
00:28:01,380 --> 00:28:02,370
I've seen how close you are

705
00:28:02,370 --> 00:28:03,650
to Manager Qi.

706
00:28:04,260 --> 00:28:05,060
How has Manager Qi

707
00:28:05,060 --> 00:28:06,210
been treating you?

708
00:28:06,890 --> 00:28:08,100
W-Well, that's obvious, isn't it?

709
00:28:08,100 --> 00:28:09,370
Putting aside the fact

710
00:28:09,370 --> 00:28:10,500
that we're relatives,

711
00:28:10,500 --> 00:28:12,580
he's always looked after me

712
00:28:12,580 --> 00:28:14,110
and treated me really well.

713
00:28:14,860 --> 00:28:16,270
He's given you

714
00:28:16,540 --> 00:28:17,710
tremendous support,

715
00:28:17,710 --> 00:28:18,610
both at work and in your personal life,

716
00:28:18,610 --> 00:28:19,690
hasn't he?

717
00:28:20,690 --> 00:28:21,500
Yes.

718
00:28:22,260 --> 00:28:24,060
He's closer to me than my own family.

719
00:28:24,060 --> 00:28:25,390
Then let me ask you this.

720
00:28:25,440 --> 00:28:27,500
Is there anything you've been hiding

721
00:28:27,600 --> 00:28:28,550
from Manager Qi?

722
00:28:29,450 --> 00:28:30,250
Or

723
00:28:30,650 --> 00:28:31,820
have you ever done anything

724
00:28:31,820 --> 00:28:33,100
to betray him?

725
00:28:35,270 --> 00:28:37,340
No, no. How...

726
00:28:37,370 --> 00:28:38,260
How could I?

727
00:28:38,490 --> 00:28:39,290
Are you sure?

728
00:28:39,510 --> 00:28:40,340
I'm sure.

729
00:28:42,890 --> 00:28:44,100
Let him say it again.

730
00:28:44,540 --> 00:28:45,470
Absolutely not.

731
00:28:47,980 --> 00:28:48,780
What's wrong?

732
00:28:59,140 --> 00:28:59,910
Go back.

733
00:29:00,120 --> 00:29:00,890
Okay.

734
00:29:02,540 --> 00:29:02,930
Alright.

735
00:29:02,930 --> 00:29:04,730
Then... Manager Qi, I'll be off.

736
00:29:08,140 --> 00:29:17,230
[Members Management Department]

737
00:29:23,780 --> 00:29:26,340
We've already given him his chance.

738
00:29:28,300 --> 00:29:29,300
Let's proceed

739
00:29:29,890 --> 00:29:31,060
as we agreed.

740
00:29:31,260 --> 00:29:32,060
Okay.

741
00:29:32,610 --> 00:29:33,670
I'll go arrange it.

742
00:29:39,600 --> 00:29:43,520
[Wugang New Pipeline
Engineering Technology Co., Ltd.]

743
00:29:55,720 --> 00:30:02,490
[Wugang Petrochemical Plant]

744
00:30:00,340 --> 00:30:01,130
You guys,

745
00:30:01,370 --> 00:30:02,370
take down those signs

746
00:30:02,370 --> 00:30:03,260
and send them back.

747
00:30:02,510 --> 00:30:10,400
[Wugang New Pipeline
Engineering Technology Co., Ltd.]

748
00:30:03,450 --> 00:30:04,980
-Okay.
-Okay.

749
00:30:12,260 --> 00:30:13,520
What are you doing?

750
00:30:12,360 --> 00:30:15,490
[Put People First,
Seek Truth and Innovate]

751
00:30:14,370 --> 00:30:15,820
Put that down! Put it down!

752
00:30:15,820 --> 00:30:16,410
Don't touch it! Put it down!

753
00:30:16,410 --> 00:30:17,320
What's going on?

754
00:30:17,320 --> 00:30:18,210
What do you mean?

755
00:30:18,210 --> 00:30:19,850
-Who do you work for?
-Seal all the documents

756
00:30:19,850 --> 00:30:21,370
and pack them up to take with us.

757
00:30:21,370 --> 00:30:22,370
Wait. What...

758
00:30:22,370 --> 00:30:23,300
What do you mean?

759
00:30:25,000 --> 00:30:27,490
The head office
is taking back control of the subsidiary.

760
00:30:27,490 --> 00:30:28,340
Naturally,

761
00:30:28,340 --> 00:30:29,560
all these assets have to be cleared out.

762
00:30:29,560 --> 00:30:31,500
Who authorized you to do this?

763
00:30:31,500 --> 00:30:32,210
I did.

764
00:30:34,690 --> 00:30:36,000
General Manager Geng Jian

765
00:30:36,000 --> 00:30:37,230
has seriously neglected his duties

766
00:30:37,230 --> 00:30:38,610
and embezzled project funds

767
00:30:38,610 --> 00:30:39,740
totaling

768
00:30:39,740 --> 00:30:41,060
500,000 yuan.

769
00:30:41,370 --> 00:30:41,820
What?

770
00:30:41,820 --> 00:30:42,580
That money alone

771
00:30:42,580 --> 00:30:43,940
is enough to cover all your salaries

772
00:30:43,940 --> 00:30:45,460
for several years.

773
00:30:44,010 --> 00:30:49,820
[Put People First,
Seek Truth and Innovate]

774
00:30:45,610 --> 00:30:47,340
Yet he pocketed it for himself.

775
00:30:47,820 --> 00:30:49,170
The head office has decided

776
00:30:49,170 --> 00:30:50,300
to dismiss Geng Jian

777
00:30:50,300 --> 00:30:51,370
and take back the subsidiary.

778
00:30:51,370 --> 00:30:52,260
M-Manager Qi,

779
00:30:52,280 --> 00:30:54,650
that's a terrible thing to say.

780
00:30:54,650 --> 00:30:56,170
Whether or not these allegations are true,

781
00:30:56,170 --> 00:30:57,210
you can fire me,

782
00:30:57,210 --> 00:30:57,930
but you can't

783
00:30:57,930 --> 00:30:58,850
slander my character.

784
00:30:58,850 --> 00:30:59,580
Yes,

785
00:30:59,580 --> 00:31:00,650
all the money

786
00:31:00,650 --> 00:31:01,690
went through my hands.

787
00:31:01,690 --> 00:31:02,370
It went through my hands,

788
00:31:02,370 --> 00:31:03,740
but not a single penny

789
00:31:03,740 --> 00:31:04,820
went into my own pocket.

790
00:31:04,820 --> 00:31:05,980
Everyone knows

791
00:31:05,980 --> 00:31:06,980
that project of ours

792
00:31:06,980 --> 00:31:08,370
couldn't have gone ahead

793
00:31:08,370 --> 00:31:09,690
without us putting our own money into it.

794
00:31:09,690 --> 00:31:10,650
All that money

795
00:31:10,650 --> 00:31:11,370
went toward

796
00:31:11,370 --> 00:31:12,500
covering the project's shortfall.

797
00:31:12,500 --> 00:31:13,650
Godfather,

798
00:31:13,650 --> 00:31:15,130
save these words for the authorities

799
00:31:15,130 --> 00:31:15,850
and the police!

800
00:31:15,850 --> 00:31:17,510
Let's see if they believe you!

801
00:31:17,580 --> 00:31:18,260
No... Well...

802
00:31:18,260 --> 00:31:18,980
What I'm saying now

803
00:31:18,980 --> 00:31:20,370
isn't about explaining myself
to the police.

804
00:31:20,370 --> 00:31:20,980
Whatever happens,

805
00:31:20,980 --> 00:31:22,260
I've done my best

806
00:31:22,280 --> 00:31:23,300
for this subsidiary

807
00:31:23,300 --> 00:31:24,980
and for Shan.

808
00:31:24,980 --> 00:31:26,370
I have a clear conscience.

809
00:31:26,370 --> 00:31:27,580
But as for you...

810
00:31:27,580 --> 00:31:28,340
You kept saying

811
00:31:28,340 --> 00:31:29,300
you want to help Shan,

812
00:31:29,300 --> 00:31:30,580
yet look what you're doing now.

813
00:31:30,580 --> 00:31:31,300
You're taking back the subsidiary.

814
00:31:31,300 --> 00:31:32,690
What is Shan supposed to...

815
00:31:32,690 --> 00:31:33,500
Shan...

816
00:31:33,690 --> 00:31:34,850
I won't say anything more.

817
00:31:34,850 --> 00:31:35,500
You...

818
00:31:36,210 --> 00:31:37,170
Fine. I...

819
00:31:37,820 --> 00:31:38,610
Fine.

820
00:31:39,340 --> 00:31:40,130
You...

821
00:31:41,390 --> 00:31:42,630
Okay.

822
00:31:42,780 --> 00:31:44,210
Well... Shan.

823
00:31:44,740 --> 00:31:45,610
I must

824
00:31:45,650 --> 00:31:46,980
apologize to you today.

825
00:31:47,300 --> 00:31:48,340
Because of what Godfather has done,

826
00:31:48,340 --> 00:31:49,820
he has to be dismissed.

827
00:31:49,820 --> 00:31:50,850
As for you...

828
00:31:51,980 --> 00:31:53,060
If you still want

829
00:31:53,080 --> 00:31:55,510
to try your luck in Guangdong,

830
00:31:55,610 --> 00:31:56,340
that's no problem.

831
00:31:56,340 --> 00:31:57,780
I can make a call

832
00:31:57,820 --> 00:31:58,610
to Guangdong Petrochemical.

833
00:31:58,610 --> 00:31:59,500
You can go anytime.

834
00:31:59,500 --> 00:32:00,300
Over there,

835
00:32:00,570 --> 00:32:01,450
you can still make

836
00:32:01,450 --> 00:32:02,580
a name for yourself.

837
00:32:03,210 --> 00:32:04,020
Mo,

838
00:32:05,130 --> 00:32:06,610
you've been running around

839
00:32:06,610 --> 00:32:08,100
and doing so much for me

840
00:32:08,260 --> 00:32:09,500
ever since I got out.

841
00:32:09,500 --> 00:32:10,650
I've seen it all.

842
00:32:11,130 --> 00:32:11,780
I also know

843
00:32:11,780 --> 00:32:13,210
you genuinely care about my sister,

844
00:32:13,210 --> 00:32:14,870
and that's why you've gone out of your way

845
00:32:14,870 --> 00:32:15,790
to help me.

846
00:32:16,210 --> 00:32:17,940
But I've already made up my mind

847
00:32:18,450 --> 00:32:19,780
about my future.

848
00:32:19,780 --> 00:32:21,310
I'm not going to Guangzhou.

849
00:32:22,020 --> 00:32:22,690
Alright.

850
00:32:22,690 --> 00:32:23,980
If you have any ideas,

851
00:32:24,000 --> 00:32:25,170
just let me know.

852
00:32:25,980 --> 00:32:27,540
I'm going to start a new company.

853
00:32:27,540 --> 00:32:29,270
I've already thought of a name:

854
00:32:29,300 --> 00:32:30,540
Fuwenshan

855
00:32:30,750 --> 00:32:32,760
Pipeline Engineering Technology Co., Ltd.

856
00:32:32,760 --> 00:32:34,270
The "Fu" comes from Chen Fu,

857
00:32:34,270 --> 00:32:35,540
the "Wen" from Zhang Wenying,

858
00:32:35,540 --> 00:32:37,360
and the "Shan" from my name, Chen Shan.

859
00:32:37,360 --> 00:32:39,170
I don't have any other special skills.

860
00:32:39,170 --> 00:32:40,560
This is what I studied,

861
00:32:40,590 --> 00:32:41,610
so I'll stay

862
00:32:41,610 --> 00:32:43,370
in the petrochemical industry.

863
00:32:43,370 --> 00:32:44,060
There's one more thing.

864
00:32:44,060 --> 00:32:45,470
I don't want to hide it from you, Mo.

865
00:32:45,470 --> 00:32:47,210
Once the new company is established,

866
00:32:47,210 --> 00:32:48,370
we'll bid on

867
00:32:48,370 --> 00:32:49,820
Project 713 Phase 2.

868
00:32:49,980 --> 00:32:50,820
That means

869
00:32:50,980 --> 00:32:51,930
we may become

870
00:32:51,930 --> 00:32:52,820
competitors.

871
00:32:53,300 --> 00:32:54,370
If the day comes

872
00:32:54,370 --> 00:32:56,520
when we have to go head-to-head,

873
00:32:57,650 --> 00:32:59,060
I won't hold back.

874
00:32:59,480 --> 00:33:00,740
I hope you understand.

875
00:33:04,500 --> 00:33:05,300
Well...

876
00:33:05,910 --> 00:33:08,060
It seems you've been thinking about this

877
00:33:08,060 --> 00:33:09,610
for quite some time.

878
00:33:09,760 --> 00:33:11,170
You've got the guts
to dream big and make things happen.

879
00:33:11,170 --> 00:33:12,100
You have my support.

880
00:33:12,100 --> 00:33:12,820
Alright?

881
00:33:12,930 --> 00:33:14,820
Tell me if you lack

882
00:33:14,820 --> 00:33:15,680
any resources.

883
00:33:16,350 --> 00:33:17,740
Give him a business card.

884
00:33:17,740 --> 00:33:18,540
He...

885
00:33:18,820 --> 00:33:19,980
He is familiar with the suppliers

886
00:33:19,980 --> 00:33:21,580
and construction teams

887
00:33:21,610 --> 00:33:22,370
at the head office.

888
00:33:22,370 --> 00:33:23,300
If you have any problems,

889
00:33:23,300 --> 00:33:24,260
just call him.

890
00:33:24,290 --> 00:33:24,930
Yes.

891
00:33:25,860 --> 00:33:26,750
Thank you, Mo.

892
00:33:26,980 --> 00:33:29,310
Then I'll keep things strictly business.

893
00:33:31,370 --> 00:33:32,700
Don't just stand there.

894
00:33:32,850 --> 00:33:33,850
Take them with us.

895
00:34:01,930 --> 00:34:02,740
Godfather.

896
00:34:04,820 --> 00:34:06,370
What was Qi Mo talking about

897
00:34:06,930 --> 00:34:07,820
just now?

898
00:34:12,380 --> 00:34:13,210
Shan.

899
00:34:14,980 --> 00:34:17,980
If they want to find fault with you,
they'll find a way.

900
00:34:19,730 --> 00:34:21,250
It's not that simple.

901
00:34:22,730 --> 00:34:23,900
Was he targeting me?

902
00:34:24,130 --> 00:34:25,330
He was targeting you.

903
00:34:25,900 --> 00:34:27,250
It was just an excuse.

904
00:34:27,250 --> 00:34:27,900
He just doesn't want you

905
00:34:27,900 --> 00:34:28,940
to stay in this city

906
00:34:28,940 --> 00:34:30,460
or join the subsidiary.

907
00:34:36,100 --> 00:34:36,730
Were...

908
00:34:36,730 --> 00:34:38,590
Were you just talking out of anger

909
00:34:38,610 --> 00:34:39,710
when you said you were going to start

910
00:34:39,710 --> 00:34:40,830
your own company?

911
00:34:42,770 --> 00:34:43,580
Godfather,

912
00:34:44,020 --> 00:34:45,389
I haven't told you...

913
00:34:45,860 --> 00:34:46,980
about this before.

914
00:34:47,690 --> 00:34:49,219
I've been thinking about it

915
00:34:49,500 --> 00:34:50,860
for a long time.

916
00:34:51,540 --> 00:34:52,980
I was already working on the idea

917
00:34:52,980 --> 00:34:53,940
when I was in prison.

918
00:34:53,940 --> 00:34:55,800
I've already thought it through.

919
00:34:56,060 --> 00:34:58,190
I want to use all my compensation money

920
00:34:58,460 --> 00:34:59,690
and mortgage the house

921
00:34:59,690 --> 00:35:00,690
to raise

922
00:35:00,810 --> 00:35:01,980
the capital to start

923
00:35:01,980 --> 00:35:02,910
the new company.

924
00:35:03,060 --> 00:35:03,940
I've even picked out a location

925
00:35:03,940 --> 00:35:04,900
for the office.

926
00:35:06,380 --> 00:35:08,100
It'll be right next door to this company.

927
00:35:08,100 --> 00:35:09,500
And I already have an idea

928
00:35:09,580 --> 00:35:11,240
of whom to bring onto the team.

929
00:35:12,770 --> 00:35:13,580
Godfather,

930
00:35:14,900 --> 00:35:16,830
don't worry about all the details.

931
00:35:17,130 --> 00:35:19,330
Just get ready to make a fortune with me.

932
00:35:22,810 --> 00:35:23,980
Shan,

933
00:35:24,860 --> 00:35:26,210
I've realized

934
00:35:26,210 --> 00:35:27,610
I really can't keep seeing you

935
00:35:27,610 --> 00:35:29,380
as the little boy

936
00:35:29,380 --> 00:35:29,980
you used to be.

937
00:35:29,980 --> 00:35:31,330
You've grown into

938
00:35:31,540 --> 00:35:32,980
a man now.

939
00:35:34,380 --> 00:35:36,240
You can stand on your own two feet.

940
00:35:36,250 --> 00:35:37,500
Listening to the way

941
00:35:37,500 --> 00:35:38,020
you spoke to Qi Mo

942
00:35:38,020 --> 00:35:39,290
just now,

943
00:35:39,770 --> 00:35:40,730
the composure you showed,

944
00:35:40,730 --> 00:35:41,460
the way...

945
00:35:41,650 --> 00:35:43,050
you handled yourself...

946
00:35:43,060 --> 00:35:44,540
You really impressed me.

947
00:35:46,810 --> 00:35:47,290
Great.

948
00:35:47,290 --> 00:35:48,210
I...

949
00:35:48,290 --> 00:35:50,210
I'm an old man
with only half a life left in me.

950
00:35:50,210 --> 00:35:51,650
I'll stand by you all the way.

951
00:35:51,650 --> 00:35:53,060
I've got the experience

952
00:35:53,460 --> 00:35:54,610
and the technical know-how.

953
00:35:54,610 --> 00:35:56,070
Then let's do it together.

954
00:35:56,380 --> 00:35:57,170
Let's do it!

955
00:35:57,860 --> 00:35:58,540
Let's do it!

956
00:36:02,690 --> 00:36:03,380
He wants to bid for

957
00:36:03,380 --> 00:36:04,810
Project 713 Phase 2?

958
00:36:05,460 --> 00:36:06,290
What is he thinking?

959
00:36:06,290 --> 00:36:07,690
He wants to compete with you?

960
00:36:07,690 --> 00:36:08,820
That's a good thing.

961
00:36:11,580 --> 00:36:12,940
Here, here.

962
00:36:13,810 --> 00:36:15,920
I think it's a good thing.

963
00:36:16,540 --> 00:36:17,330
Look,

964
00:36:17,330 --> 00:36:19,380
