965
00:36:19,500 --> 00:36:20,500
didn't go astray,

966
00:36:20,500 --> 00:36:21,170
and is on the right path.

967
00:36:21,170 --> 00:36:22,380
Isn't that great?

968
00:36:23,210 --> 00:36:24,330
Be... Be gentle.

969
00:36:25,380 --> 00:36:26,290
Secondly,
since he wants to start a company,

970
00:36:26,290 --> 00:36:28,130
we should encourage him.

971
00:36:28,900 --> 00:36:30,360
He wants to prove himself.

972
00:36:30,500 --> 00:36:31,610
There's no problem with that.

973
00:36:31,610 --> 00:36:32,380
He just can't shake

974
00:36:32,380 --> 00:36:34,510
that self-righteous attitude of his.

975
00:36:34,570 --> 00:36:35,850
Starting a company?

976
00:36:36,940 --> 00:36:37,770
But

977
00:36:38,580 --> 00:36:39,940
I'm worried about the fact

978
00:36:39,940 --> 00:36:41,290
that he wants to bid on

979
00:36:41,730 --> 00:36:42,980
Project 713 Phase 2.

980
00:36:43,250 --> 00:36:45,380
After all, our company is much bigger

981
00:36:45,540 --> 00:36:47,000
and has plenty of capital.

982
00:36:47,210 --> 00:36:49,380
If he takes out such a huge loan

983
00:36:49,460 --> 00:36:50,210
and things go wrong,

984
00:36:50,210 --> 00:36:50,980
he could lose everything.

985
00:36:50,980 --> 00:36:52,380
What then?

986
00:36:52,730 --> 00:36:54,130
How about you talk to him?

987
00:36:55,170 --> 00:36:56,230
I won't talk to him.

988
00:36:56,420 --> 00:36:58,750
He won't listen
until he hits a brick wall.

989
00:37:00,060 --> 00:37:01,020
I still think

990
00:37:01,540 --> 00:37:03,470
you should try to talk him out of it.

991
00:37:03,730 --> 00:37:05,810
He's family, after all.

992
00:37:05,980 --> 00:37:07,610
We can't just stand by and watch him

993
00:37:07,610 --> 00:37:08,540
get himself into serious trouble,

994
00:37:08,540 --> 00:37:09,170
can we?

995
00:37:11,130 --> 00:37:13,590
I really don't want
to get involved anymore.

996
00:37:13,980 --> 00:37:14,980
Go make dinner.

997
00:37:16,380 --> 00:37:18,110
I'm going to make dinner, then.

998
00:37:18,690 --> 00:37:20,220
But think about what I said.

999
00:37:28,370 --> 00:37:29,150
[Shimo Village]

1000
00:37:31,730 --> 00:37:33,330
It should be this way, right?

1001
00:37:33,380 --> 00:37:34,540
Is it reliable?

1002
00:37:34,880 --> 00:37:36,110
It should be fine.

1003
00:37:36,860 --> 00:37:37,770
Where are they?

1004
00:37:39,380 --> 00:37:40,170
Shan.

1005
00:37:40,220 --> 00:37:40,910
Over here.

1006
00:37:40,980 --> 00:37:41,770
You're here.

1007
00:37:41,860 --> 00:37:43,100
We've been waiting for you.

1008
00:37:43,100 --> 00:37:43,610
Come on.

1009
00:37:43,610 --> 00:37:45,060
Come to the table.

1010
00:37:48,010 --> 00:37:49,730
Come sit here.

1011
00:37:51,360 --> 00:37:53,700
You three? Starting a company?

1012
00:37:53,720 --> 00:37:54,940
Why can't the three of us start a company?

1013
00:37:54,940 --> 00:37:55,210
That's right.

1014
00:37:55,210 --> 00:37:57,290
The three of us are starting a company,

1015
00:37:57,290 --> 00:37:58,210
and we'd like to invite you

1016
00:37:58,210 --> 00:37:59,020
to join us.

1017
00:38:00,810 --> 00:38:01,580
Chen Shan,

1018
00:38:02,610 --> 00:38:03,860
we came here today

1019
00:38:04,900 --> 00:38:06,630
out of respect for your father.

1020
00:38:07,020 --> 00:38:07,770
It doesn't mean

1021
00:38:07,770 --> 00:38:09,380
we have to work with you.

1022
00:38:09,380 --> 00:38:11,540
Well, I'm grateful

1023
00:38:11,730 --> 00:38:13,380
you came out of respect for my father.

1024
00:38:13,380 --> 00:38:14,500
But I believe

1025
00:38:14,960 --> 00:38:17,100
we'll definitely end up working together.

1026
00:38:17,100 --> 00:38:18,020
Because we have

1027
00:38:18,020 --> 00:38:19,290
a common target—

1028
00:38:20,130 --> 00:38:21,130
Qi Mo.

1029
00:38:22,020 --> 00:38:23,100
I heard

1030
00:38:23,580 --> 00:38:24,580
as soon as you got out of prison,

1031
00:38:24,580 --> 00:38:26,640
your brother-in-law found you a job.

1032
00:38:26,920 --> 00:38:28,920
What grudge do you have against him?

1033
00:38:29,750 --> 00:38:31,210
Even you guys think so?

1034
00:38:31,550 --> 00:38:32,980
It seems this Qi Mo

1035
00:38:33,580 --> 00:38:35,130
is really good at pretending.

1036
00:38:35,130 --> 00:38:36,330
As you all know,

1037
00:38:36,540 --> 00:38:37,460
my sister and I

1038
00:38:37,480 --> 00:38:39,420
have had a good relationship
since childhood.

1039
00:38:39,420 --> 00:38:40,170
But now because of him,

1040
00:38:40,170 --> 00:38:41,210
our family has been

1041
00:38:41,210 --> 00:38:42,290
torn apart.

1042
00:38:42,690 --> 00:38:44,210
Now every time I see Ying...

1043
00:38:44,210 --> 00:38:44,980
You have no idea,

1044
00:38:44,980 --> 00:38:46,940
but she looks at me

1045
00:38:47,560 --> 00:38:49,180
like I'm her enemy.

1046
00:38:49,770 --> 00:38:51,170
Qi Mo is taking care of me?

1047
00:38:51,940 --> 00:38:53,380
He just feels guilty.

1048
00:38:54,690 --> 00:38:55,500
Fine.

1049
00:38:56,380 --> 00:38:57,770
Even if we all know

1050
00:38:57,790 --> 00:38:59,040
Qi Mo is no good,

1051
00:39:00,170 --> 00:39:01,580
what relationship do we have with you?

1052
00:39:01,580 --> 00:39:02,540
Why do you believe

1053
00:39:02,540 --> 00:39:03,730
we will help you?

1054
00:39:03,810 --> 00:39:05,460
You can't say that.

1055
00:39:05,980 --> 00:39:07,610
Maybe it's not you helping me,

1056
00:39:07,610 --> 00:39:09,060
but me helping you.

1057
00:39:12,520 --> 00:39:13,100
We all

1058
00:39:13,100 --> 00:39:14,540
took a wrong path

1059
00:39:14,860 --> 00:39:16,060
and made some mistakes.

1060
00:39:16,060 --> 00:39:18,040
But you must still find it hard to accept

1061
00:39:18,040 --> 00:39:19,640
how things turned out.

1062
00:39:20,690 --> 00:39:22,020
Weren't all of you laid off

1063
00:39:22,020 --> 00:39:24,060
from the plant

1064
00:39:24,100 --> 00:39:25,810
because of him back then?

1065
00:39:30,650 --> 00:39:31,720
Director Feng,

1066
00:39:32,130 --> 00:39:34,340
how much do you make
per painting these days,

1067
00:39:34,340 --> 00:39:35,500
doing street art?

1068
00:39:37,130 --> 00:39:38,540
Captain He, how are you finding life

1069
00:39:38,540 --> 00:39:40,140
as a motorcycle taxi driver?

1070
00:39:41,330 --> 00:39:42,380
And you, how's business

1071
00:39:42,380 --> 00:39:43,380
at the hair salon?

1072
00:39:46,540 --> 00:39:46,940
You were

1073
00:39:46,940 --> 00:39:49,390
all skilled, experienced

1074
00:39:49,690 --> 00:39:50,330
key employees

1075
00:39:50,330 --> 00:39:51,770
at the plant

1076
00:39:51,770 --> 00:39:52,940
after all.

1077
00:39:53,120 --> 00:39:55,130
Are you really going to
give up on yourselves

1078
00:39:55,130 --> 00:39:57,260
and just drift through life like this?

1079
00:39:57,310 --> 00:39:58,580
Putting everything else aside,

1080
00:39:58,580 --> 00:40:00,350
I genuinely believe

1081
00:40:00,380 --> 00:40:01,650
that if we can

1082
00:40:02,060 --> 00:40:03,430
come together

1083
00:40:03,450 --> 00:40:05,120
and work on this,

1084
00:40:06,020 --> 00:40:07,130
we have what it takes to win

1085
00:40:07,130 --> 00:40:08,860
the bid for Project 713 Phase 2.

1086
00:40:14,470 --> 00:40:15,540
Most importantly,

1087
00:40:15,580 --> 00:40:17,020
we can prove ourselves.

1088
00:40:17,020 --> 00:40:17,610
Right?

1089
00:40:17,630 --> 00:40:19,100
We can show everyone

1090
00:40:19,100 --> 00:40:20,240
who looked down on us

1091
00:40:20,260 --> 00:40:21,210
that we're capable of doing this.

1092
00:40:21,210 --> 00:40:22,060
So why turn down the chance

1093
00:40:22,060 --> 00:40:23,130
to work together?

1094
00:40:26,420 --> 00:40:27,130
Anyway, I've already

1095
00:40:27,130 --> 00:40:28,660
put everything on the line.

1096
00:40:29,650 --> 00:40:31,130
My father's compensation money

1097
00:40:31,130 --> 00:40:32,940
and the money I got from mortgaging

1098
00:40:32,940 --> 00:40:34,540
the Chen family's old house.

1099
00:40:34,540 --> 00:40:36,020
I'm betting it all

1100
00:40:36,690 --> 00:40:37,610
on winning the bid

1101
00:40:37,610 --> 00:40:39,130
for Project 713 Phase 2.

1102
00:40:39,500 --> 00:40:40,380
Whatever

1103
00:40:41,100 --> 00:40:42,690
you decide today,

1104
00:40:42,940 --> 00:40:43,730
that's fine.

1105
00:40:44,130 --> 00:40:44,810
If you want to

1106
00:40:44,810 --> 00:40:45,940
join the three of us,

1107
00:40:45,940 --> 00:40:46,730
let's do it.

1108
00:40:47,100 --> 00:40:47,900
If not,

1109
00:40:48,130 --> 00:40:49,330
you haven't come here for nothing.

1110
00:40:49,330 --> 00:40:51,060
At least stay for a meal before you go.

1111
00:40:51,060 --> 00:40:51,980
I, Chen Shan,

1112
00:40:52,610 --> 00:40:55,010
am determined to make something of myself.

1113
00:40:55,250 --> 00:40:56,720
I'm going to win this bid

1114
00:40:56,750 --> 00:40:58,060
and carry on the unfinished work

1115
00:40:58,060 --> 00:40:59,020
of my parents.

1116
00:40:59,020 --> 00:40:59,860
I'll give it everything I've got

1117
00:40:59,860 --> 00:41:02,590
to make sure this pipeline
gets built for Wugang.

1118
00:41:03,090 --> 00:41:03,750
Let's do it!

1119
00:41:07,770 --> 00:41:08,570
Chen Shan.

1120
00:41:08,570 --> 00:41:09,420
When I saw your company's name

1121
00:41:09,420 --> 00:41:10,650
on the business card,

1122
00:41:10,860 --> 00:41:11,690
I knew

1123
00:41:11,900 --> 00:41:13,250
starting this company

1124
00:41:14,060 --> 00:41:16,130
wasn't a spur-of-the-moment decision.

1125
00:41:16,130 --> 00:41:17,090
To be honest,

1126
00:41:17,650 --> 00:41:18,890
your dad and I

1127
00:41:19,650 --> 00:41:20,900
didn't see eye to eye.

1128
00:41:22,130 --> 00:41:24,670
But I have to say,

1129
00:41:24,730 --> 00:41:25,820
I admire him.

1130
00:41:26,060 --> 00:41:27,460
Just for your dad,

1131
00:41:27,650 --> 00:41:29,250
I'm willing to work with you.

1132
00:41:30,540 --> 00:41:31,770
Running a company

1133
00:41:32,730 --> 00:41:33,980
requires money.

1134
00:41:34,460 --> 00:41:35,590
If I'm going to do it,

1135
00:41:36,250 --> 00:41:37,310
I'll do it for real.

1136
00:41:37,940 --> 00:41:39,270
This is my life savings.

1137
00:41:40,090 --> 00:41:40,900
I'm buying in.

1138
00:41:41,700 --> 00:41:42,710
[China Construction Bank]

1139
00:41:43,900 --> 00:41:44,690
Feng Jian.

1140
00:41:47,650 --> 00:41:48,210
He.

1141
00:41:48,210 --> 00:41:49,980
I'm doing this because of you.

1142
00:41:51,980 --> 00:41:53,050
Don't worry.

1143
00:41:53,420 --> 00:41:54,570
I know the rules.

1144
00:41:55,500 --> 00:41:56,990
It's just sharing the risk, right?

1145
00:41:56,420 --> 00:41:57,020
[Agricultural Bank of China]

1146
00:41:57,940 --> 00:41:58,540
Come on.

1147
00:41:58,900 --> 00:42:01,090
I don't want to keep washing
people's hair anymore.

1148
00:42:01,090 --> 00:42:02,090
Qianqian and I

1149
00:42:02,340 --> 00:42:03,520
don't have much money,

1150
00:42:03,520 --> 00:42:04,960
but we can help with

1151
00:42:04,980 --> 00:42:06,060
all the day-to-day work at the company.

1152
00:42:06,060 --> 00:42:06,690
Right, Qianqian?

1153
00:42:06,690 --> 00:42:07,210
Yes.

1154
00:42:08,020 --> 00:42:09,020
I'm buying in too.

1155
00:42:11,460 --> 00:42:13,870
[Chuanzhe Bank Demand Savings Account]

1156
00:42:11,500 --> 00:42:12,530
Count me in.

1157
00:42:12,900 --> 00:42:13,820
I'll buy in too.

1158
00:42:15,500 --> 00:42:16,860
Come on, have they served the food yet?

1159
00:42:16,860 --> 00:42:18,090
Let them serve the food. Come on.

1160
00:42:18,090 --> 00:42:19,060
Here's to our success!

1161
00:42:19,060 --> 00:42:19,500
To our success!

1162
00:42:19,500 --> 00:42:20,540
To our success!

1163
00:42:30,790 --> 00:42:33,060
Bravo! Bravo!

1164
00:42:32,390 --> 00:42:34,160
[Fuwenshan Pipeline
Engineering Technology Co., Ltd.]

1165
00:42:35,410 --> 00:42:38,960
[Mourn]

1166
00:42:35,530 --> 00:42:36,820
What's going on?

1167
00:42:36,820 --> 00:42:38,650
