-What are you doing?

1168
00:42:38,650 --> 00:42:39,810
What are you doing?

1169
00:42:39,980 --> 00:42:40,910
Don't touch it.

1170
00:42:41,570 --> 00:42:42,630
Just leave it here.

1171
00:42:42,940 --> 00:42:44,540
