1207
00:43:46,610 --> 00:43:47,860
He opened his company.

1208
00:43:47,860 --> 00:43:48,940
Just let him do whatever he wants.

1209
00:43:48,940 --> 00:43:49,570
He can...

1210
00:43:50,860 --> 00:43:52,810
