1225
00:44:10,630 --> 00:44:11,570
Well...

1226
00:44:11,650 --> 00:44:12,650
Shan, let me tell you.

1227
00:44:12,650 --> 00:44:14,210
Your company is up and running.

1228
00:44:14,210 --> 00:44:15,540
Do whatever you want.

1229
00:44:15,540 --> 00:44:16,940
Don't ruin your relationship

1230
00:44:16,940 --> 00:44:18,130
