1232
00:44:18,770 --> 00:44:19,420
I'll take her away.

1233
00:44:19,420 --> 00:44:20,340
Let's go.

1234
00:44:20,340 --> 00:44:21,570
Let's go home.

1235
00:44:21,820 --> 00:44:22,650
Manager Qi.

1236
00:44:23,210 --> 00:44:25,130
The bidding for Project 713 Phase 2

1237
00:44:25,130 --> 00:44:26,690
